---
title: Steps 2 and 9 — User / Admin log in
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User or Admin
    participant V as validateLogin
    participant C as controllers/auth
    participant UM as User model
    participant RT as RefreshToken model

    U->>V: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    alt email or password missing
        V-->>U: 400 Bad Request
    end
    V->>C: login()
    C->>UM: findOne({email}).select(+password)
    C->>C: bcrypt.compare(password)
    alt wrong email or password
        C-->>U: 401 Invalid credentials
    end
    C->>RT: save hashed refresh token
    C-->>U: 200 {token, role: user or admin} + HttpOnly cookies
